@startuml
' bt-view-kind: deployment
' bt-view-id: mcp-server:deployment
title MCP Server - Deployment
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: stdio
' bt-element-id: repo
' bt-element-id: backend_node

node "Local Stdio Process\nResponsibility: Host MCP protocol adapter\nContract: One client transport\n[[../../../../scripts/wos_mcp_stdio_launcher.py source]]" as stdio
node "Repository Workspace\nResponsibility: Provide scoped read/write targets\nContract: Configured root containment\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/repo_dotenv.py source]]" as repo
node "Backend Process\nResponsibility: Execute governed remote actions\nContract: HTTP\n[[../../../../backend/Dockerfile source]]" as backend_node

stdio --> backend_node : "HTTP\ncontract: governed delegation\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/backend_client.py source]]"
stdio --> repo : "scoped filesystem access\ncontract: configured root\n[[../../../../tools/mcp_server/repo_dotenv.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: deployment
Concern: Local stdio process, scoped repository and backend boundary
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
